  "model": {
   "attributes": null,
   "items": [
    {
     "body": "<p>This is a subscription-based model that provides organizations with software that is centrally hosted and accessed by users via a web browser, app, or other software. In other words, this is software that is not stored locally but instead is run from the cloud.</p>",
     "title": "Software as a Service (SaaS)",
     "_graphic": {
      "alt": "A smartphone",
      "src": "en-US/assets/5f300dd9d51743a9bbe9e98ee266a168.png",
      "attribution": ""
     },
     "strapline": "Tap + for more information",
     "_ariaLevel": 0,
     "_index": 0,
     "_parentId": "63ac2cfc5b32bd08d6d84867"
    },
    {
     "body": "<p>This subscription-based model provides a platform that allows an organization to develop, run and manage its applications on the service’s hardware, using tools that the service provides. This platform is accessed via the public cloud.</p>",
     "title": "Platform as a Service (PaaS)",
     "_graphic": {
      "alt": "A server",
      "src": "en-US/assets/07e9dd07760a4668b111e8470233bc9c.png",
      "attribution": ""
     },
     "strapline": "Tap + for more information",
     "_ariaLevel": 0,
     "_index": 1,
     "_parentId": "63ac2cfc5b32bd08d6d84867"
    },
    {
     "body": "<p>This subscription-based model provides virtual computing resources such as hardware, software, servers, storage, and other infrastructure components over the internet. An organization will buy access to this infrastructure and use it via the public cloud.</p>",
     "title": "Infrastructure as a Service (IaaS)",
     "_graphic": {
      "alt": "A desktop and modem",
      "src": "en-US/assets/228538bb2101478ab6f9d3cde5e9ab89.png",
      "attribution": ""
     },
     "strapline": "Tap + for more information",
     "_ariaLevel": 0,
     "_index": 2,
     "_parentId": "63ac2cfc5b32bd08d6d84867"
    }
   ]
  },
